      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "了解！\n那我们要同心协力！\n想出超越连续剧的超爆火热训练项目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "579fb215916db40e95f410323a6bace8f24484e6fe63fced049339c640af3deb",
