    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203bf16a9aa34fad1d8dacfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是……我们拟定的项目为反复进行冲刺、\n兔子跳、高抬腿、霍巴克舞，\n再跑完附近最长的步道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f3dda88dda75a8bddb437f0be8918618eb6708e4ef3c28cde794eb67e4e3bf2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
