      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不过在青竹回忆的强烈要求下\n还多了一项条件，就是她要同时拖着轮胎进行，\n而我这个训练员则是要抱膝坐在上面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fad5b89b5cc16c1fc4d8248be4eb71fc1374edf2ffff2d1cb21ae4984333a5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
